64 < 1 - Run: python3 -c "from ledger.core import statement; assert statement('2026-09-01,cash,-12.50,coffee\n2026-09-02,card,900,rent, deposit\n').splitlines()[-1] == 'entries: 2  total: 887.50'" [M2]
